<report>
<title>Incidence rate difference (IRD) meta-analysis</title>
<br />
<table>
<tr><th>Stratum</th><thfirst>Table (a, person-time exposed, b, person-time not exposed)</thfirst><thspan/><thspan/><thspan/><th></th></tr>
<block name="inputs">
<tr><td><in>st</in></td><td><in>a</in></td><td><inu>pt1</inu></td><td><in>b</in></td><td><inu>pt2</inu></td><td><in>lb</in></td></tr>
</block>
</table>
<br />
<table>
<tr><th>Stratum</th><th>IRD</th><thfirst><ci><in>pc</in>% CI (approximate)</ci></thfirst><thspan/><th></th></tr>
<block name="ir"><tr><td><in>st</in></td><td><inu>ird</inu></td><td><ci><inu>lci</inu></ci></td><td><ci><inu>uci</inu></ci></td><td><in>lb</in></td></tr></block>
</table>
<br />
<table>
<tr><th>Stratum</th><th>Standardized effect</th><th>Variance</th><thfirst>% Weights (fixed, random)</thfirst><thspan/><th></th></tr>
<block name="ir"><tr><td><in>st</in></td><td><inu>yi</inu></td><td><inu>vi</inu></td><td><in>wt</in></td><td><in>dwt</in></td><td><in>lb</in></td></tr></block>
</table>
<br />
<subtitle>Fixed effects (inverse variance)</subtitle>
<p>Pooled IRD = <inu>rmh</inu> (<ci><in>pc</in>% CI = <inu>from</inu> to <inu>to</inu></ci>)<br />
Z (test IRD differs from 0) = <inu>z</inu>  <pval><inp>p_z</inp></pval></p>

<subtitle>Non-combinability of studies</subtitle>
<p>Cohran Q = <inu>qc</inu>  (df = <in>df</in>)  <pval><inp>xp</inp></pval><br />
Moment-based estimate of between studies variance = <inu>tausq</inu><br />
I<sub>2</sub> (inconsistency) = <in>isq</in>% (<ci><in>pc1</in>% CI = <in>llisq</in>% to <in>ulisq</in>%</ci>) </p>

<subtitle>Random effects (DerSimonian-Laird)</subtitle>
<p>Pooled IRD = <inu>dsird</inu> (<ci><in>pc</in>% CI = <inu>dsll</inu>  to  <inu>dsul</inu></ci>)<br />
Z (test IRD differs from 0) = <inu>dz</inu>  <pval><inp>dp</inp></pval></p>

<block name="egger">
<subtitle>Bias indicators</subtitle>
<p>Begg-Mazumdar: Kendall's <in>tau</in>  <pval><inp>p2</inp></pval><br />
Egger: bias = <in>a</in> (<ci><in>pc_egger</in>% CI = <in>cl</in> to <in>cu</in></ci>)  <pval><inp>p</inp></pval></p>
</block>
</report>
